  "implementation": {
    "keys": "block state_dict exposes BF16 meta placeholders, so ComfyUI's standard LoRA key map and add_patches accept block keys without allocating block weights",
    "application": "ComfyUI applies host-layer patches; block patches are never applied by ComfyUI (parameter-free blocks) and are consumed by the XDNA runtime",
    "runtime": "pre_run validates the patch contract, reads base block tensors from the checkpoint on demand, and builds or reuses the effective BF16 packed cache keyed by checkpoint and LoRA content; one runtime per patches_uuid, reused across prompts and clones",
    "switching": "a newly selected runtime suspends the previously resident one: XRT buffers and AIR runners close and the packed-cache mapping is released; reopening remaps through the in-process verified lease (identity re-checked)",
